{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，公伐戎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"二、夏，公至自伐戎。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"三、曹殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"何以不名？眾也。曷為眾殺之？不死于曹君者也。君死乎位曰滅，曷為不言其滅？為曹羈諱也。此蓋戰也，何以不言戰？為曹羈諱也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會宋人、齊人伐徐。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_55_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_55","textTraditional":"五、冬十有二月癸亥朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}